Why promising: This is the main route left for matching the truncation upper rate under power tails.
Critical checks: Candidate tools include Le Cam/Fano families, terminal observations with small TV/KL, multi-scale hidden states, or block designs where the best fixed quote remains separated across unresolved parts.

